{"ID":"20240205153802-eezauif","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153802-eezauif","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153802-eezauif\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091527-g2l8gih\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611143047-yl3h65x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4703,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619181959-4082bih\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"169秦艽","type":"doc","updated":"20240814115618"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091527-g2l8gih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091527-g2l8gih","updated":"20240206091530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产甘肃、宁夏、青海、四川等地。\n【性状】\t秦艽：呈类圆柱形，上粗下细，扭曲不直，长1030cm，直径13cm。表面黄棕色或灰黄色，有纵向或扭曲的纵皱纹，顶端有残存茎基及纤维状叶鞘。质硬而脆，易折断，断面略显油性，皮部黄色或棕黄色，木部黄色。气特异，味苦、微涩。\n麻花艽：呈类圆锥形，多由数个小根纠聚而膨大，直径可达7cm 。表面棕褐色，粗糙，有裂隙呈网状孔纹。质松脆，易折断，断面多呈枯朽状。\n小秦艽：呈类圆锥形或类圆柱形，长815cm，直径0.21cm。表面棕黄色。主根通常1 个，残存的茎基有纤维状叶鞘，下部多分枝。断面黄白色。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t袪风湿，舒筋络，清虚热。用于风湿痹痛，筋脉拘挛，骨节酸痛，日晡潮热，小儿疳积发热。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091521-5k09bgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091521-5k09bgj","updated":"20240206091521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091521-rdhxco4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160931-noq45ie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160931-noq45ie","updated":"20240205160931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"秦艽"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"N